<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN CENTRAL BANK RESERVES RISE IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN CENTRAL BANK RESERVES RISE IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said on Monday</p>
<p>that its gold and foreign reserves rose to 8.7 billion kroons in</p>
<p>June versus 8.3 billion kroons for the previous month.</p>
<p>    CENTRAL BANK RESERVES			    June '97  May '97</p>
<p>    Gold (mln kroons)				   37.7     37.7</p>
<p>    Convertible foreign currency (bln kroons)   8.62     8.24</p>
<p>    Special drawing rights (SDR, mln kroons)    0.78     0.41</p>
<p>    Notes and coins in circulation (bln kroons) 5.37     5.09</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
